000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. COND88X1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  GRADE             PIC 999.
000060     88  PASSED        VALUE 60 THRU 100.
000070     88  PERFECT       VALUE 100.
000080     88  BAD-GRADE     VALUES 101 THRU 999.
000090 01  COLOR-CODE        PIC X.
000100     88  WARM          VALUES "R" "O" "Y".
000110     88  COOL          VALUE "G" "B".
000120 01  END-FLAG          PIC X       VALUE "N".
000130     88  ALL-DONE      VALUE "Y"   FALSE "N".
000140 01  N                 PIC 9       VALUE 0.
000150 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000160     MOVE 75 TO GRADE
000170     IF PASSED DISPLAY "75: PASSED" END-IF
000180     IF NOT PERFECT DISPLAY "75: NOT PERFECT" END-IF
000190     MOVE 250 TO GRADE
000200     IF BAD-GRADE DISPLAY "250: BAD GRADE" END-IF
000210     SET PERFECT TO TRUE
000220     DISPLAY "AFTER SET PERFECT: " GRADE
000230     MOVE "O" TO COLOR-CODE
000240     EVALUATE TRUE
000250         WHEN WARM DISPLAY "O IS WARM"
000260         WHEN COOL DISPLAY "O IS COOL"
000270     END-EVALUATE
000280     PERFORM UNTIL ALL-DONE
000290         ADD 1 TO N
000300         IF N = 3 SET ALL-DONE TO TRUE END-IF
000310     END-PERFORM
000320     DISPLAY "LOOPED " N " TIMES, FLAG " END-FLAG
000330     SET ALL-DONE TO FALSE
000340     DISPLAY "AFTER SET FALSE, FLAG " END-FLAG
000350     STOP RUN.
